BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-17T00:00:00&endDate=2026-10-19T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nPICCADILLY LINE: Saturday 17\, from 0100\, and all day Sunday 18 October\, including Friday and Saturday Night Tube\, no service between Hammersmith and Heathrow (all terminals) / Uxbridge. Use METROPOLITAN LINE services between Rayners Lane and Uxbridge\, and ELIZABETH LINE services between Central London and Heathrow\, and for connections between terminals. Replacement bus services operate.
DTEND:20261019T002900Z
DTSTART:20261017T000000Z
SUMMARY:Piccadilly: Part Closure
UID:bcbd9db0-1540-4eb5-9369-895af4e4fee4@bcbd.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-08T09:02:26&endDate=2026-10-09T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nPiccadilly Line: Severe delays between King's Cross St. Pancras and Cockfosters while we fix a signal failure at Arnos Grove. Tickets are being accepted on London Buses\, Great Northern and London Overground services via any reasonable route. MINOR DELAYS on the rest of the line. 
